{"articleNo":"2681","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2681&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2011학년도 1학기 농촌희망재단 농어업인자녀장학금 신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2010.12.16","hit":"13417","attachments":[{"name":"2011학년도 1학기 농촌희망재단 농어업인자녀장학금 신청 양식 및 기준1.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2681&attachNo=1796"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt\">\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"533\" bgcolor=\"#ccffff\" height=\"42\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2011학년도 1학기 농촌희망재단 농어업인자녀장학금 신청 안내</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><!--StartFragment--><font color=\"#000000\"></font>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;<br><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">1</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">. 지원대상</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\"> : </span></font><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10.9pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">장학금 지급일 기준(2011년 1학기) 2학년 이상 재학&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;중인</font> </span></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 10.9pt; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">농림수산업인의 자녀</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">로서 ‘10년 2학기 이수학점이 12학점이상이<br>&nbsp;&nbsp; 고 평점평균이 2.6이상인 학생</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</span><p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">2. 선발인원 : 대학전체 5명</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">3. 지 급 액</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> : 년1회 300만원<br>&nbsp;&nbsp; - 등록금 전액의 타 장학금을 받는 학생은 지급 제외(등록금범위내중복가능) <br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">4. 선발 기준<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- ‘10.2학기 이수학점이 12학점이상이고 평점평균이 2.6이상인 학생으로<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 성적순으로 선발</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 성적순으로 선발하되, 가정형편이 어려운자는 성적에 10%가산점을 부여하<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 여 합산</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<br></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">5. 신청방법</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- 신청학생은 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">재단 홈페이지(</span><a href=\"http://www.rhof.or.kr/\" target=\"_self\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">www.Rhof.or.kr</span></a><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">)에서 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">해당 장학금 신청서&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp; &lt;서식2&gt;를&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">출력하여 내용 기재 후 도장날인</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">(서명불가)</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">을 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">하고 관련서류<br>&nbsp; 를&nbsp;구비하여 학생과(글로벌관458호)로 제출</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">6. 제출서류<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1) 장학금 신청서 1부 &lt;서식2&gt;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 부모의 농림수산업인 확인서류 1부 (아래서류 중 1부)<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 농지원부 또는 어업허가증(사본) 또는 어업원부 1부.<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 전문임업인의 경우 선발 또는 선정 증명서 사본 1부.<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 산림조합조합원의 경우 조합원 증명서(산림조합장 발행) 및 사업실적증명<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 서</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;(산림조합장 또는&nbsp;시장·군수 발행) 각 1부.<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.7pt\">&nbsp;- </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\">기능인영림단의 경우 영림단원 확인서(국유림관리소장 또는 산림조합장&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 발행) 1부.</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 상기 서류가 없는 경우는 농림수산업종사 확인서 1부 &lt;서식4&gt;</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3) 부모의 주민등록등본 1부<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(학생과 부모의 주소가 다를 경우 가족관계확인서 1부 추가제출)<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;4) ’10년 2학기 성적증명서 1부&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;5) 총장추천서 1부 &lt;서식5&gt;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ※ 본인 학과의 학과장님 또는 지도교수님께&nbsp;추천글을 받은&nbsp;후 학생과로&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;제출하시면 됩니다.<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;6) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10.7pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">기초생활수급자증명서, 차상위계층증명서, 의료급여수급자증명서 중 1부<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (해당자에 한함)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">7. 신청 및 서류제출 기간 :<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 10.7pt; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">2011.1.10(월)~1.12(수)-글로벌관458호<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2011.1.13(목)~1.19(수) 17:00까지-본관101호로 제출<br><br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">8. 기타 자세한 사항은</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">재단 홈페이지(</span><a href=\"http://www.rhof.or.kr/\" target=\"_self\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">www.Rhof.or.kr</span></a><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">)참조&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(문의 : 054-478-7065)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;※ 우편접수가능 :&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-&nbsp;&nbsp;1.10(월)~1.12(수)&nbsp;&nbsp; 경북 구미시 양호동 1번지&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 금오공과대학교 학생과 (글로벌관 458호)<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; -&nbsp; 1.13(목)~1.19(수)&nbsp;&nbsp; 경북 구미시 양호동 1번지&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;금오공과대학교 학생과 (본관 101호)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(우730-701) - 농촌희망재단장학금신청서로 겉면 표기</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: #333333; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2010년 12월 14일<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 금오공과대학교 학생과장</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
